        "notes": "\"Beyond The Limits contains mature content, including:\r\n\r\nViolence: Realistic depictions of gunfights, physical altercations, and criminal activities such as theft and confrontations with the law.\r\n\r\nDrug and Alcohol Use: Some characters may consume alcohol or illegal substances in certain situations, reflecting a crime-driven and street-life environment.\r\n\r\nStrong Language: Frequent use of profanity and explicit dialogue.\r\n\r\nMature Themes: The game explores themes related to organized crime, delinquency, and the consequences of illegal actions.\r\n\r\nThe game does not currently include depictions of sex, sexual abuse, non-consensual sex, or self-harm. While some NPCs in the beach area of the map wear bikinis, this is not explicit or sexual in nature. However, please note that the game may include sexual content in future updates, which will be clearly communicated to players.\r\n\r\nPlayers should be aware that the game is designed for an adult audience due to its themes and content.\""
